Package: @PKGNAME@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Stellar Shell <stellar@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libqt6core6, libqt6gui6, libqt6quick6,
 libqt6qml6, libqt6dbus6, libqt6network6, libqt6opengl6,
 qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-effects,
 qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript,
 liblayershellqtinterface6, libwayland-client0, breeze-cursor-theme,
 systemd, libpam0g, @WMDEP@
Recommends: pipewire, wireplumber, network-manager,
 power-profiles-daemon, pulseaudio-utils, x11-xserver-utils,
 x11-xkb-utils, libglib2.0-bin, xdg-utils, util-linux,
 udisks2, bluez, cups-client
Description: Stellar Shell, escritorio Wayland glassmorphism / XP remasterizado
 Stellar Shell es un escritorio ligero para Wayland con estética
 glassmorphism y Windows XP remasterizado. Incluye panel inferior,
 menú Inicio, widgets, centro de configuración y arranque automático
 para Hyprland, Wayfire, labwc y KWin.
